{"sourceUrl":"http://www.tib.cas.cn/xwdt/tzgg/202508/t20250829_7928327.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:04:25.254545+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.tib.cas.cn/xwdt/tzgg/202508/t20250829_7928327.html","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span>中国科学院天津工业生物技术研究所接收优秀应届本科毕业生作为推荐免试研究生（以下简称“推免生”，包含推免硕士生和直博生），为保证接收推免生工作的顺利进行，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>一、申请条件 </strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.tib.cas.cn/xwdt/tzgg/202508/t20250829_7928327.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>．中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱科学事业，道德品质良好，遵纪守法。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>．申请者须获得所在学校当年推荐免试资格，并在中国研究生招生信息网“教育部推免服务系统”中获得所在学校推荐免试资格名单备案。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>．诚实守信，品行端正，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>．在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，在学期间专业主干课无重修科目或补考记录。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>．外国语程度良好，具有较强的外国语听、说、读、写及综合应用能力。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>．具有较强的调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>．身体健康状况符合规定的体检要求，心理健康状况良好。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>二、申请材料</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>申请人将报名材料按以下顺序扫描合并成一个</span></span></span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span><span><span>文档，发送至</span></span></span></span><span><span>tib_yzb@tib.cas.cn</span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span><span><span>文件和邮件的主题均命名为“推免</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>本科学校名称</span></span></span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span><span><span>本人姓名”，接收邮件的截止日期为</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2025</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>16</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span>。初审通过接到通知后，面试时申请人携带</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>套纸质版材料。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span><span><span>必须提供材料 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>）打印并本人签字的附件</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>《推免生申请表》 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）加盖学校教务部门（或院系）公章的本科前三年课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单） </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>）个人简历及专业学习情况介绍 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>）英语等级证书复印件。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>）第二代居民身份证扫描件（正反面扫描到一页</span></span></span></span><span><span>A4</span></span><span><span><span><span>纸上）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span><span><span>自愿提供的材料 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>）申请推荐免试攻读中国科学院大学研究生专家推荐书（由副教授或相当职称以上专家推荐，推荐书需密封并在封口骑缝处签字），无需提供电子版。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其他原创性工作成果的复印件或证明。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>）大学期间的获奖证书复印件。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>）对申请有参考价值的其他材料。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三、考核</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>研究生招生小组与申请导师对申请人提交的电子版申请材料进行初步遴选和资格审核，对初审通过者，通过邮件或电话通知参加考核。未通过遴选者，不另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>考核时间预计为</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2025</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月下旬</strong></span></span></span><span><span>。具体考核时间另行通知，请各位申请人及时关注电话或邮件通知。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>在我所招生工作领导小组的统一领导下，组织专家形成考核小组对申请者进行考核。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span>考核内容：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>）思想政治品德考核：主要考查考生政治态度、思想品德、人生观、价值观、工作学习态度、团队合作精神、科研道德及遵纪守法等方面的基本情况。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）专业知识考核：重点考查学生对知识掌握的深度和广度，对知识灵活运用的程度以及实验技能和实际动手能力等，了解考生从事科研工作的潜力和创造性。核查学生历年的学习成绩，特别是本科所学专业主干课程成绩；考查学生的学习能力、创新精神和其他特长等综合素质。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>）英语口语及听力测试：通过考生的自述及专家的提问，考查英语听、说能力及语言运用能力。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span><span><span>考核形式：现场面试。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>四、拟录取 </strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span><span><span>坚持德智体美劳全面衡量、择优录取、保证质量、宁缺毋滥的原则，研究所招生工作领导小组将对考核及材料审核结果进行综合评议，确定拟录取名单。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>被确定接收的推免生须在教育部规定的时间内，登录“教育部推免服务系统”填报，并通过“教育部推免服务系统”与我所完成接受复试通知、接受拟录取通知等网上确认程序。截止规定时间仍未完成相关接收手续或未落实接收单位的推免生不再保留推荐免试接收资格。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span>推免生录取层次（推免硕士生或直博生）、录取类型（学术型硕士研究生或专业型硕士研究生）及录取专业等以“教育部推免服务系统”确认的信息为准，经确定后的录取层次、录取类型及录取专业原则上不得变更。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>被接收的推免生不得再以统考生身份报名参加全国硕士生统一入学考试。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>．研究所拟接收的推免生且已在教育部“推免服务系统”中确认拟录取的学生名单将在研究所官网公示。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>五、复审和录取 </strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>2026</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>4</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>月底前</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>按照中国科学院大学通知要求研究所将进行推免拟录取资格复审，对复查审核不合格者取消推免拟录取。复审合格者与统考生一起发放录取通知书。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>对拟录取的推免生，出现下列情况之一的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，取消其录取资格： </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>已被各培养单位接收的推免生，若再报名参加当年硕士研究生招生考试，取消其推免录取资格。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>在本科阶段最后一学年（四年制的指第七、八学期，五年制的指第九、十学期）专业主干课程成绩有不及格科目。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span><span><span>本科毕业设计（论文）未取得良好以上（含良好）成绩。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span><span><span>新生入学报到前未获得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5. </span></span><span><span><span><span>政审不合格。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6. </span></span><span><span><span><span>考试作弊者或违纪（法）受到“警告”以上处分的，或有其他情节严重的违法乱纪行为受到处罚者。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>7. </span></span><span><span><span><span>申请人提交的材料有弄虚作假者。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>六、其他 </strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span><span><span>研究所推免生招生专业目录中公布的拟招生人数为预计招生人数，仅作参考，不作为实际录取的依据。实际录取人数以后续“教育部推免服务系统”中确定接收的推免生人数为准。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span><span><span>中国科学院大学实行弹性学制，研究所研究生培养学制：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>） 推荐免试硕士研究生基本学制一般为</span></span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>年，最长修读年限（含休学）不得超过</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>年。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>）直博生基本学制一般为</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>年，最长修读年限（含休学）不得超过</span></span></span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>年。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span><span><span>本通知如有与国家以及中国科学院大学新出台的招生政策（含相关时间节点）不符的事项，以上级单位新政策为准。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span><span><span>请各位申请者随时关注研究所官网“通知公告”栏，任何相关的信息及通知会发布在此，由于未及时查看相关通知所造成的一切后果自负。 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5. </span></span><span><span><span><span>来参加考核的学生差旅、食宿等所有费用由学生本人承担。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>七、联系方式 </strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>邮寄地址：天津空港经济区西七道</span></span></span></span><span><span>32</span></span><span><span><span><span>号 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>邮 编：</span></span></span></span><span><span>300308 </span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系人：陈老师 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>电 话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>022-84861998 </span></span></p><p><span><span>E-mail: tib_yzb@tib.cas.cn </span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>单位网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span>www.tib.cas.cn </span></span></p><p><span><span><span><a href=\"http://www.tib.cas.cn/xwdt/tzgg/202508/P020250829378427472323.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件1：推免生申请表\">附件1：推免生申请表</a></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><a href=\"http://www.tib.cas.cn/xwdt/tzgg/202508/P020250829378427675582.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"附件2：天津工业生物技术研究所2026年推荐免试生招生需求\">附件2：天津工业生物技术研究所2026年推荐免试生招生需求</a></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"5838e6c389c1e2506f4a81360491ad8b22750a9015490b8df5af44ae27e37836","textLength":2385,"sourceSha256":"8920d61acbbd6a9579ca9f2ea09694a8b4904bdcbce40bc7ad48575a5c31e8b1","selector":"#zoom","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b2383cd8d998b255a778","title":"2025年中国科学院天津工业生物技术研究所接收2026年推荐免试生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:04:25.254545+00:00"}
